streamBuddy is a modified version of "Streaming enhanced" (Netflix-Prime-Auto-Skip),
Copyright (C) Marvin Krebber (Dreamlinerm), https://github.com/Dreamlinerm/Netflix-Prime-Auto-Skip

streamBuddy began from Streaming enhanced version 1.1.108 in October 2026 and has since been
largely rewritten. New in streamBuddy: Letterboxd and IMDb ratings and the Letterboxd profile
integration, title-page and episode ratings, page features, the playback engine (skips with undo,
per-show rules, speed control, autoplay limit), watch stats, onboarding, the interface and branding.
Still derived from Streaming enhanced: the rating-card lookup and cache in
src/content-script/shared-functions.ts, the settings page shell (including Backup and Changelog),
the storage composables and the build configuration.

